---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: labContent.articles
  size: 1
  alias: article
permalink: "wissen/{{ article.slug }}/index.html"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ article.title }}"
  description: "{{ article.summary }}"
---
<main class="content-detail shell"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/investment-lab.html">Investment Lab</a><span>›</span><a href="/investment-lab.html#wissen">Immobilienwissen</a><span>›</span><span>{{ article.title }}</span></nav><article class="science-article"><header><span class="lab-kicker">{{ article.category }}</span><h1>{{ article.title }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ article.summary }}</p><p class="content-meta">Fischer &amp; Geserich Real Estate GmbH · aktualisiert {{ article.updated }}</p></header>
<section><h2>Definition und fachliche Einordnung</h2><p>{{ article.definition or article.body }}</p>{% if article.mechanics %}<p>{{ article.mechanics }}</p>{% endif %}</section>
{% if article.formulae and article.formulae.length %}<section><h2>Rechenlogik</h2><div class="lab-formula-card">{% for formula in article.formulae %}<div class="lab-formula">{{ formula }}</div>{% endfor %}</div></section>{% endif %}
{% if article.example %}<section class="lab-example-section"><h2>{{ article.example.title or "Praxisbeispiel" }}</h2><div class="lab-example-grid"><div><h3>Annahmen</h3><ul>{% for item in article.example.assumptions %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div><div><h3>Rechnung</h3><ul>{% for item in article.example.steps %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></div></div>{% if article.example.interpretation %}<div class="lab-interpretation"><strong>Interpretation</strong><p>{{ article.example.interpretation }}</p></div>{% endif %}</section>{% endif %}
<div class="lab-pro-con"><section><h2>Entscheidende Einflussgrößen</h2><ul>{% for item in article.drivers %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section><section><h2>Grenzen und Risiken</h2><ul>{% for item in article.risks %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section></div>
{% if article.checklist and article.checklist.length %}<section><h2>Prüfcheckliste</h2><ul>{% for item in article.checklist %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>{% endif %}
{% if article.sources and article.sources.length %}<section class="lab-source-section"><h2>Quellen &amp; Rechtsgrundlagen</h2><ul>{% for source in article.sources %}<li><a href="{{ source.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ source.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul><p class="lab-source-note">Rechts- und Förderstände können sich ändern. Vor einer konkreten Transaktion ist der aktuelle Stand erneut zu prüfen.</p></section>{% endif %}
<aside class="article-note"><strong>Hinweis</strong><p>Die Beispiele dienen der fachlichen Veranschaulichung und ersetzen keine Rechts-, Steuer-, Finanzierungs- oder Anlageberatung.</p></aside><div class="article-actions"><a class="lab-btn lab-btn-gold" href="/investment-lab.html">Im Investment Lab weiterarbeiten</a><a class="lab-btn lab-btn-ghost" href="/ankaufsberatung.html">Ankaufsberatung</a></div></article></main>
